WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.986
In one minute, you will find your saved drafts, your badges, and your account.

00:00:04.986 --> 00:00:06.147
We start on the map.

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:10.438
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.819
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.819 --> 00:00:17.328
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.328 --> 00:00:18.683
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:22.794
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.794 --> 00:00:23.478
Tap Allow.

00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:29.309
Look at the top of the map.

00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:30.513
Tap the person icon.

00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:36.593
Drafts lists anything you started and saved.

00:00:36.593 --> 00:00:38.436
You can finish it on any device.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.839
Tap Badges.

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:45.567
Winners keep a crown, and the awards your home has won are listed here.

00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:48.158
Tap Account.

00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:51.790
This is where you change your name and photo, and delete your account.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:58.116
That is your profile: your drafts, your badges, and your account.

00:00:59.516 --> 00:01:01.873
Next up: Vote in a contest.
